{"title":"02. 모양 마을 — 별·하트·마름모 만나기","lang":"korean","lang_option":"1","device":"dotpad320","audioPath":"","items":[{"page":1,"title":"모양 마을에 오신 걸 환영해요","graphic":{"name":"","data":""},"text":{"name":"1.txt","data":"310815092a120011251c360011232a02151c3800232008230011231209230c0a0e120000000000000a2536082a102311151000201d11251000000000091d11250011230208250a2500183102151023361a23132a10001123102a2211250a250000000000202302082500150c0e32001a2309232020150100","plain":"여기는 모양 마을이야! 아까 만났던 동그라미, 세모, 네모 말고도\n별이랑 하트, 마름모도 살고 있어. 하나씩 만나러 가볼까?"},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":2,"title":"별","graphic":{"name":"star.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"2.txt","data":"15080e1200183102151c3200000000000000000020182c2825011a2312000000000000000000000020082501281504280e2215000a23200e04000817150c0e320020251220082a262a102500000000001a23092320201501002815322a113112200e0000201d0e1825021017260000000000000000000000","plain":"이건 별이야. 뾰족한 꼭짓점이 다섯 개 있어.\n손끝으로 하나씩 짚으면서 세어볼래?"},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":3,"title":"하트","graphic":{"name":"heart.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"3.txt","data":"15080e12001a23132a1c32000d17202825011d121825021025011a23120020231215000a0d000817150c082510002310171025000000000000000000091710310823113112200e00000000000000000020182c2825011a23081d00112312092332000000","plain":"이건 하트야. 위쪽엔 볼록한 산이 두 개 있고,\n아래로 내려가면서 뾰족하게 만나."},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":4,"title":"마름모","graphic":{"name":"diamond.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"4.txt","data":"15080e12001123102a2211251c32000000000000091d1125102a020020230220282301000000000008150d023100201d0d120011251c3615281532000d17100023101710001c3631321d00000000000020182c2825011a2312000a1d08230000000000001a2309232020150100150c0e3200000000000000","plain":"이건 마름모야. 네모를 살짝 기울여 세운 모양이지.\n위, 아래, 양옆에 뾰족한 데가 하나씩 있어."},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":5,"title":"큰 별 작은 별","graphic":{"name":"compare.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"5.txt","data":"08230d120a1d00200e122a0200000000000000000815280d122a102510003d12202825011d1200000b2a12001831021500150c08250000000000000025102a12202825011d12002823012a12000000001831021500150c0e32000e092a002028250115000a0e000b2a022008232600000000000000000000","plain":"가운데 선을 기준으로, 왼쪽엔 큰 별이 있고\n오른쪽엔 작은 별이 있어. 어느 쪽이 더 클까?"},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":6,"title":"하트를 찾아라","graphic":{"name":"roomA.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"6.txt","data":"091d0008173a0018233600280d361d00000000001a230923112312000a23021023320000000000000923110e2815092a12000a2300183102151c32001a23132a082300150c092a12001823362a0200003023052318250210172600000000000000000000","plain":"네 개의 방 중에 하나만 달라. 나머지는 다 별이야.\n하트가 있는 방을 찾아볼래?"},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":7,"title":"마름모를 찾아라","graphic":{"name":"roomB.dtm","data":""},"text":{"name":"7.txt","data":"15180e121d12001123102a221125102a02000000302305231825282338000923110e2815000000001823361d12001a23132a082300150c0e32000000","plain":"이번엔 마름모를 찾아보자! 나머지 방엔 하트가 있어."},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}},{"page":8,"title":"모양 마을 완주!","graphic":{"name":"","data":""},"text":{"name":"8.txt","data":"280e36112302002823021a170c0e380015281d0018310210001a23132a10000000000000000000001123102a2211252008232815000a230000000000112312092318270c091d32000a232a221d000000200a2500201710250d120011251c36000000000011232a021d200e00112312092338000000000000","plain":"정말 잘했어! 이제 별, 하트, 마름모까지 다 만나봤네.\n다음에 또 새로운 모양 마을에서 만나!"},"audio":{"fileName":"","tempFile":null},"dotPadInfo":{"width":60,"height":40,"totalCell":300,"totalCellLine":10}}]}